Great game, really good cosmetic vehicle customization and enjoyable physics for both drifting and RWD touge. Super fun to roam around on custom maps once you get over the base game locations. Only setbacks IMO are the below (wouldn't make or break my opinion, game is still mint without them);

- lack of variety in engine swap options. would be sick to have things like k-swaps and rotary
- cannot directly chose the type of forced induction. just either stock induction, turbo upgrade or whatever comes with the motor swap. would be good to be able to chose your induction to affect performance,…
